[style name="UI"]

XBot: Hey, check[portrait=happy] it out...[portrait=default]
join XBot (happy) left
XBot: This icosphere must be for me!
XBot: Here is a question for you,
update XBot (default)
XBot: [shake2]Mirror[/shake2], mirror, on the wall, who in this land is [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=1.0 val=1.0]fairest[/rainbow] of all?
- You, my queen
	XBot (happy): Sweet.
	set {XBot.MirrorQuestionName} = "XBot"
	XBot: I know it must be me.
- Snow White
	XBot: How dare you!
	set {XBot.MirrorQuestionName} = "Snow White"
	jump XBot_timeline/End
- I have some other idea...
	[text_input text="Name" var="XBot.MirrorQuestionName" placeholder="Antiduspig"]
	XBot: {XBot.MirrorQuestionName}? Never heard of it.
XBot: Anyways, if it's not [shake]Snow White[/shake], I agree.
label End
leave XBot